{"4262710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Airship 2: Kingdoms Ablaze", "steam_appid": 4262710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4891630], "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/459f8c576f555e8b11d982f8daf7802f.avif?t=1787125689\" width=616 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan the QR code and come aboard the Revolution Industry Discord, the home port of the Skypunk Franchise community and our crew. This is where we gather our announcements, talk through development, share behind-the-scenes progress, drop suspiciously deep lore for fans who enjoy reading too much, and handle support and feedback as close to real time as our small team can manage. So grab your phone, scan away, and we’ll see you on deck.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/ba1e3056cc1b6b96617f728f86beaddf.avif?t=1787125689\" width=1080 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/9c2910681434b7f250ffbfdf59a60f7e.webp?t=1787125689\" width=379 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The sky is ablaze with conflicts, will you reclaim your place among the high sky or burn everything to the ground?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player Skypunk action simulation strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your commander's career across 4 career tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your fleet from 25 ships and their variants along with 500+ parts and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day and night cycles and dynamic weather affecting gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6+ hours of story campaign and 60+ hours of sandbox progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out 60 ports across the Segson Archipelago</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic faction politics and diplomacy, living economic simulation and industries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical fleet combat with real-time battles and extensive sandbox replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller-focused experience with both laid-back and intense atmosphere </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/9d7ac72b9e8a91d084c8a72b0d967c83.webp?t=1787125689\" width=610 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/ce77a434d3bc3e38c74e9a110fc8a0ee.poster.avif?t=1787125689\" width=1080 height=940 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/ce77a434d3bc3e38c74e9a110fc8a0ee.webm?t=1787125689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/ce77a434d3bc3e38c74e9a110fc8a0ee.mp4?t=1787125689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/d5bb1cfc80683c2a03f9246fd3c5d271.webp?t=1787125689\" width=610 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>...A fallen hero...</strong><br> <br><strong>...A fractured sky...</strong><br> <br><strong>...A war that has not yet begun... </strong><br><br><strong>...But cannot be avoided...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Airship 2: Kingdoms Ablaze</strong> is a skypunk action simulation strategy game and the continuation of <i>Airship: Kingdoms Adrift</i>. Command your fleet across a living archipelago where trade, warfare, diplomacy, and industry collide in a world still burning from the consequences of the Dream Fall Incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are no longer a newcomer to the skies. You are a branded traitor, a fugitive commander seeking redemption in a continent rearming for inevitable war. The sky is not free. It is now contested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/1fee1872e0a315e16bb58d68866ba769.webp?t=1787125689\" width=478 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Create your commander's profile. Define your expertise. Shape your future.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/1ef60fd7f1eca04a61f137aef2b2bb5a.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/86bae593c657b41faf8c1bb5d1225c7b.avif?t=1787125689\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras_big/86bae593c657b41faf8c1bb5d1225c7b.webp?t=1787125689 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/2d8f34f6dc9935f8297055cd9b3f9b45.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a persistent third-person flagship perspective, you command your fleet directly from the bridge. Every journey, conversation, negotiation, and battle unfolds around you, reinforcing your identity as a fleet commander with personality and agency.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your Commander’s career</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit from officers and crews </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop relationships with factions and key figures including Jean and Minerva</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Influence political alignment across the Segson Archipelago</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions determine whether you rebuild what was lost, or burn what remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/4fbe52cac674a01fad12eb6b59a670f0.webp?t=1787125689\" width=536 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Segson Archipelago is not a backdrop. It is a dynamically simulated world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/1ef60fd7f1eca04a61f137aef2b2bb5a.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/3c8752da6dbf808505e828cfbdc49b04.avif?t=1787125689\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras_big/3c8752da6dbf808505e828cfbdc49b04.avif?t=1787125689 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/2d8f34f6dc9935f8297055cd9b3f9b45.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ports generate quests, trade opportunities, diplomatic tensions, and fleet activity. Factions govern their own assets and pursue survival and dominance. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit and settle in ports across the Segson Archipelago</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and gain access to various ships with multiple variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge array of ship parts and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day and night cycles and dynamic weather affecting gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war has not yet begun, but the world is already moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/c179286ca5d31ee7d4ca05746f2b4075.webp?t=1787125689\" width=469 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Highly customizable airships lie at the heart of Kingdoms Ablaze.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/1ef60fd7f1eca04a61f137aef2b2bb5a.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/7ac0d6baa1d98ccd58e432bf75a8e24c.avif?t=1787125689\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras_big/7ac0d6baa1d98ccd58e432bf75a8e24c.avif?t=1787125689 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/2d8f34f6dc9935f8297055cd9b3f9b45.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refit, repaint, restructure, and rearm your vessels to meet escalating demands. Optimize performance. Salvage rare technologies. Expand industrial capabilities. Prepare for the conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simplified hitbox mechanics and clearer performance presentation make tactical decisions readable and decisive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you specialize in trade convoys, artillery-heavy battlecruisers, or agile raiding fleets, your doctrine defines your path to rebuild and revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/bba3c51a44895a2daf9d2e2d2f608c0e.webp?t=1787125689\" width=458 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Where diplomacy fails, firepower is the answer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/1ef60fd7f1eca04a61f137aef2b2bb5a.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/e9be28144631f02f0843a325ba7de5fd.avif?t=1787125689\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras_big/e9be28144631f02f0843a325ba7de5fd.avif?t=1787125689 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/2d8f34f6dc9935f8297055cd9b3f9b45.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage rival fleets in intense, tactical aerial combat from a controller-focused third-person perspective. Manage positioning, firing arcs, wind direction, and coordinated broadsides. Switch between Navigation, Tactical, and Close-Up camera modes to maintain battlefield awareness. Victory is earned through preparation, tactics, and superior firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/f754dad42946d2018cfd0aa49eff9b3f.webp?t=1787125689\" width=768 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Power is not sustained by guns alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/1ef60fd7f1eca04a61f137aef2b2bb5a.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/5690060fced08b89f6d5a3c1dca6a76f.avif?t=1787125689\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras_big/5690060fced08b89f6d5a3c1dca6a76f.avif?t=1787125689 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/2d8f34f6dc9935f8297055cd9b3f9b45.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover profitable trade routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build factories and connect production lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure resource rights and real estate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delegate assets to officers or command directly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economic strength fuels military dominance. Neglect either at your peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/97b00338263f51e4910c08c3fdd4f3d4.webp?t=1787125689\" width=375 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sphaera was shattered by the Great Cataclysm. Its land now floats across three altitude belts; the Blue, Green, and Grey Belts. Factions and nations come and go over centuries, only the fight for survival and control endures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/1ef60fd7f1eca04a61f137aef2b2bb5a.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/9ec9a2fbe98116fab7f381a9e399b38b.avif?t=1787125689\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras_big/9ec9a2fbe98116fab7f381a9e399b38b.avif?t=1787125689 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/2d8f34f6dc9935f8297055cd9b3f9b45.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of <i>Adrift</i>, falling skies shift the perceived balance of power forever. Europa now stands at the edge of renewed war. Ablaze begins in the fragile calm before the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/5b904ae11c223b405996db004c1b05f1.webp?t=1787125689\" width=445 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build your own skyfaring world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/1ef60fd7f1eca04a61f137aef2b2bb5a.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/976442c7108aded1a6f9556640f636f8.avif?t=1787125689\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras_big/976442c7108aded1a6f9556640f636f8.avif?t=1787125689 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/2d8f34f6dc9935f8297055cd9b3f9b45.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kingdoms Ablaze is designed with moddability as a core principle. Optimized asset structures and system clarity support user-created content and long-term community expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your rules...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your stories... </strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <strong>Your sky...</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/ba1e3056cc1b6b96617f728f86beaddf.avif?t=1787125689\" width=1080 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/9c2910681434b7f250ffbfdf59a60f7e.webp?t=1787125689\" width=379 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The sky is ablaze with conflicts, will you reclaim your place among the high sky or burn everything to the ground?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player Skypunk action simulation strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your commander's career across 4 career tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your fleet from 25 ships and their variants along with 500+ parts and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day and night cycles and dynamic weather affecting gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6+ hours of story campaign and 60+ hours of sandbox progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out 60 ports across the Segson Archipelago</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic faction politics and diplomacy, living economic simulation and industries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical fleet combat with real-time battles and extensive sandbox replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller-focused experience with both laid-back and intense atmosphere </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/9d7ac72b9e8a91d084c8a72b0d967c83.webp?t=1787125689\" width=610 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/ce77a434d3bc3e38c74e9a110fc8a0ee.poster.avif?t=1787125689\" width=1080 height=940 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/ce77a434d3bc3e38c74e9a110fc8a0ee.webm?t=1787125689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/ce77a434d3bc3e38c74e9a110fc8a0ee.mp4?t=1787125689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/d5bb1cfc80683c2a03f9246fd3c5d271.webp?t=1787125689\" width=610 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>...A fallen hero...</strong><br> <br><strong>...A fractured sky...</strong><br> <br><strong>...A war that has not yet begun... </strong><br><br><strong>...But cannot be avoided...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Airship 2: Kingdoms Ablaze</strong> is a skypunk action simulation strategy game and the continuation of <i>Airship: Kingdoms Adrift</i>. Command your fleet across a living archipelago where trade, warfare, diplomacy, and industry collide in a world still burning from the consequences of the Dream Fall Incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are no longer a newcomer to the skies. You are a branded traitor, a fugitive commander seeking redemption in a continent rearming for inevitable war. The sky is not free. It is now contested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/1fee1872e0a315e16bb58d68866ba769.webp?t=1787125689\" width=478 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Create your commander's profile. Define your expertise. Shape your future.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/1ef60fd7f1eca04a61f137aef2b2bb5a.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/86bae593c657b41faf8c1bb5d1225c7b.avif?t=1787125689\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras_big/86bae593c657b41faf8c1bb5d1225c7b.webp?t=1787125689 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/2d8f34f6dc9935f8297055cd9b3f9b45.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a persistent third-person flagship perspective, you command your fleet directly from the bridge. Every journey, conversation, negotiation, and battle unfolds around you, reinforcing your identity as a fleet commander with personality and agency.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your Commander’s career</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit from officers and crews </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop relationships with factions and key figures including Jean and Minerva</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Influence political alignment across the Segson Archipelago</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions determine whether you rebuild what was lost, or burn what remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/4fbe52cac674a01fad12eb6b59a670f0.webp?t=1787125689\" width=536 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Segson Archipelago is not a backdrop. It is a dynamically simulated world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/1ef60fd7f1eca04a61f137aef2b2bb5a.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/3c8752da6dbf808505e828cfbdc49b04.avif?t=1787125689\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras_big/3c8752da6dbf808505e828cfbdc49b04.avif?t=1787125689 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/2d8f34f6dc9935f8297055cd9b3f9b45.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ports generate quests, trade opportunities, diplomatic tensions, and fleet activity. Factions govern their own assets and pursue survival and dominance. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit and settle in ports across the Segson Archipelago</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and gain access to various ships with multiple variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge array of ship parts and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day and night cycles and dynamic weather affecting gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war has not yet begun, but the world is already moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/c179286ca5d31ee7d4ca05746f2b4075.webp?t=1787125689\" width=469 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Highly customizable airships lie at the heart of Kingdoms Ablaze.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/1ef60fd7f1eca04a61f137aef2b2bb5a.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/7ac0d6baa1d98ccd58e432bf75a8e24c.avif?t=1787125689\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras_big/7ac0d6baa1d98ccd58e432bf75a8e24c.avif?t=1787125689 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/2d8f34f6dc9935f8297055cd9b3f9b45.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refit, repaint, restructure, and rearm your vessels to meet escalating demands. Optimize performance. Salvage rare technologies. Expand industrial capabilities. Prepare for the conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simplified hitbox mechanics and clearer performance presentation make tactical decisions readable and decisive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you specialize in trade convoys, artillery-heavy battlecruisers, or agile raiding fleets, your doctrine defines your path to rebuild and revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/bba3c51a44895a2daf9d2e2d2f608c0e.webp?t=1787125689\" width=458 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Where diplomacy fails, firepower is the answer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/1ef60fd7f1eca04a61f137aef2b2bb5a.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/e9be28144631f02f0843a325ba7de5fd.avif?t=1787125689\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras_big/e9be28144631f02f0843a325ba7de5fd.avif?t=1787125689 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/2d8f34f6dc9935f8297055cd9b3f9b45.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage rival fleets in intense, tactical aerial combat from a controller-focused third-person perspective. Manage positioning, firing arcs, wind direction, and coordinated broadsides. Switch between Navigation, Tactical, and Close-Up camera modes to maintain battlefield awareness. Victory is earned through preparation, tactics, and superior firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/f754dad42946d2018cfd0aa49eff9b3f.webp?t=1787125689\" width=768 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Power is not sustained by guns alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/1ef60fd7f1eca04a61f137aef2b2bb5a.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/5690060fced08b89f6d5a3c1dca6a76f.avif?t=1787125689\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras_big/5690060fced08b89f6d5a3c1dca6a76f.avif?t=1787125689 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/2d8f34f6dc9935f8297055cd9b3f9b45.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover profitable trade routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build factories and connect production lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure resource rights and real estate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delegate assets to officers or command directly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economic strength fuels military dominance. Neglect either at your peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/97b00338263f51e4910c08c3fdd4f3d4.webp?t=1787125689\" width=375 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sphaera was shattered by the Great Cataclysm. Its land now floats across three altitude belts; the Blue, Green, and Grey Belts. Factions and nations come and go over centuries, only the fight for survival and control endures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/1ef60fd7f1eca04a61f137aef2b2bb5a.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/9ec9a2fbe98116fab7f381a9e399b38b.avif?t=1787125689\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras_big/9ec9a2fbe98116fab7f381a9e399b38b.avif?t=1787125689 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/2d8f34f6dc9935f8297055cd9b3f9b45.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of <i>Adrift</i>, falling skies shift the perceived balance of power forever. Europa now stands at the edge of renewed war. Ablaze begins in the fragile calm before the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/5b904ae11c223b405996db004c1b05f1.webp?t=1787125689\" width=445 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build your own skyfaring world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/1ef60fd7f1eca04a61f137aef2b2bb5a.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/976442c7108aded1a6f9556640f636f8.avif?t=1787125689\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras_big/976442c7108aded1a6f9556640f636f8.avif?t=1787125689 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4262710/extras/2d8f34f6dc9935f8297055cd9b3f9b45.webp?t=1787125689\" width=780 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kingdoms Ablaze is designed with moddability as a core principle. Optimized asset structures and system clarity support user-created content and long-term community expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your rules...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your stories... </strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <strong>Your sky...</strong></p>", "short_description": "Command fleets in tactical aerial battles, build trade and industrial networks, and shape diplomacy in this skypunk action simulation strategy game where rival powers clash for control of the skies.", "supported_languages": "English, Thai, French, German, Traditional Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Polish, Portuguese 